{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "75", "x": 0.9038164196379167, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.02992682896571904, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "like engineering are gold for giving that quick start with their hands-on training", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.826795598972823, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and internships. But take philosophy graduates, for example. On paper, they seem", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8262077208877061, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "job-ready for nothing specific, yet some of them end up thriving in business or", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8259151146695473, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "tech. I suppose the reason is that those abstract courses wire your brain to tackle", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8266113616308357, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "problems in ways that no technical manual can teach. So ultimately, while job-", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.82133112145998, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "specific skills get you through the door, it's the transferable skills that help you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.8257070915382773, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "climb the career ladder.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.24681729222779855, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "2.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.025044142118860666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Well, here's the thing about internships-they let you test the waters without", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.7661520887972726, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "signing your life away. Many young graduates switch tracks after realising the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.8260114881261237, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "fact that they don't really match their first career options. Additionally, no", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.826033428466238, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "lectures or textbooks can teach you the messy stuff, like calming down a furious", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.8266100288064363, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "client or decoding your boss's cryptic emails; these are things you can only learn", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.8259028116750906, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "through real-world experience. Lastly, even the most mundane tasks, like making", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8263945213535385, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "coffee runs and handling spreadsheets, can enhance your CV and help you stand", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.8266620089580153, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "out in the job market later on.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.3038622534185152, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "3.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.025648859927639937, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "To be honest, it's nowalk in the park. As the saying goes, different fields are", "x": 0.16774843308549978, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.765753164202018, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "worlds apart. So, embarking on a brand-new career means starting from scratch:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.8263388503036225, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "you have to acquire new certifications, adapt to unfamiliar work cultures, and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.8265485138341534, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "rebuild professional networks; all of which require dedication and willpower. But", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.8260121032758466, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "on the flip side, it's liberating. I've seen people thrive after escaping dead-end", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.8267537687916706, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "jobs. So yeah, it's tough but doable with grit.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.45406720592741867, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}